OL,3,GNEWSARaids on suspected organised crime
OL,4,Asee 17 arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a suspected
OL,7,Forganised crime group have arrested 17
OL,8,Fpeople in dawn raids at 24 properties
OL,9,Fin London, Essex, Hertfordshire,
OL,10,FCambridgeshire and Suffolk.
OL,12,FMore than 800 officers took part in the
OL,13,Farrest operations in the early hours of
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FSearches are ongoing at a number of the
OL,17,Fproperties and there is expected to be
OL,18,Fa police presence for some days, the
OL,19,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
